### 获取诗词列表
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/list?page=1&size=10

### 获取诗词列表-按分类
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/list?categoryId=1&page=1&size=10

### 获取诗词详情
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/1

### 获取精选诗词
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/featured?page=1&size=12

### 搜索诗词
GET http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/search?keyword=静夜思&page=1&size=10

### 创建诗词
POST http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试诗词",
  "author": "测试作者",
  "dynasty": "唐代",
  "content": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "featured": true
}

### 更新诗词
PUT http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "静夜思-更新",
  "author": "李白",
  "dynasty": "唐代",
  "content": "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。举头望明月，低头思故乡。"
}

### 删除诗词
DELETE http://{{server_port}}/api/poetry/1
